    {0, "act.prop.order", "Game", "Change an order's settings", "change order {order}'s {prop}: {mod} {value}", "order|Dat:orders|0|;prop|Property:UnitOrder|canBeQueued|;mod|VarModifier|SetTo|;value|ValueOf:prop|1|", "", "", "advanced", 2, "@prop UnitOrder", "UnitOrder", "Changes the values of an order from orders.dat. Examples are if players can queue or interrupt the order, and the weapon or technology that it uses.", "The change applies to all units of that kind for all players. It stays for the rest of the game, or until a trigger changes it back. StarCraft reads some values only when the map loads, for example graphics files. Changes to these values do not show on the screen.", "change order Attack Unit's can be queued: set to 0: players cannot queue this order with Shift."},
