    {0, "act.listset", "Variables", "Change an item of a list", "change item {index} of {list}: {mod} {value}", "list|ListTarget||;index|Index|0|;mod|VarModifier|SetTo|;value|Number|0|", "", "", "basic", 2, "", "EUDArray,PVariable", "Changes one item of a list, or the value of one player in a player array. To select the item, use a number, a variable or constant, the loop counter, or the current player.", "Items are counted from 0. For example, a list of 10 has items 0 to 9. The game does not check an index that it calculates while it runs. An index one past the end changes memory that it must not change.", "change item 2 of wave sizes: set to 20: wave 3 has 20 enemies. Items are counted from 0."},
